From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 17:07:43 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: codecs: tfa9865: OnePlus Pad 4: middle amplifiers' gain
 and boost from stock

The two middle amplifiers (0x37 on both buses) ran below the stock
container: the TDM speaker attenuation (0x5f bits 9:5) at 7 where stock
has 5, and the maximum boost voltage (0x76 bits 15:8) at 0xd7 where stock
has 0xf0. The four outer amplifiers already run at the stock values.

Write stock's values. Every amplifier field the container sets now
matches stock; nothing is raised past it.

Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 5a30d72164bcec1c15b36a31aafac15dbff7b1ae)
---
 sound/soc/codecs/tfa9865.c | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/tfa9865.c b/sound/soc/codecs/tfa9865.c
index e77e69704852..a3dece37f89d 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/tfa9865.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/tfa9865.c
@@ -141,8 +141,8 @@ static const struct tfa9865_reg_data tfa9865_iceland_regs_0__37[] = {
 	{ .reg = 0x5b, .val = 0x6095 },
 	{ .reg = 0x5c, .val = 0x330b },
 	{ .reg = 0x01, .val = 0x0084 },
-	{ .reg = 0x76, .val = 0xd700 },
-	{ .reg = 0x5f, .val = 0x00e0 },
+	{ .reg = 0x76, .val = 0xf000 },
+	{ .reg = 0x5f, .val = 0x00a0 },
 	{ .reg = 0x00, .val = 0xf251 },
 };
 
@@ -181,8 +181,8 @@ static const struct tfa9865_reg_data tfa9865_iceland_regs_22__37[] = {
 	{ .reg = 0x5b, .val = 0x6095 },
 	{ .reg = 0x5c, .val = 0x330b },
 	{ .reg = 0x01, .val = 0x0084 },
-	{ .reg = 0x76, .val = 0xd700 },
-	{ .reg = 0x5f, .val = 0x00e0 },
+	{ .reg = 0x76, .val = 0xf000 },
+	{ .reg = 0x5f, .val = 0x00a0 },
 	{ .reg = 0x00, .val = 0xf251 },
 };
 
